# {{slug}}

> Scaffolded with `gad site new {{slug}}`.

## Getting started

```sh
# From repo root
pnpm install

# Dev server
cd sites/{{slug}}
pnpm dev
```

Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).

## Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js 16 (App Router) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| UI components | `@gad/ui` (workspace) |
| Visual context | `gad-visual-context` (workspace) |
| Deployment | Vercel |

## Environment variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` and fill in the values.

## Planning

GAD planning artifacts live in `.planning/`. Use `gad snapshot --projectid {{slug}}` to view state.
